{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>You shall not go with them.</b> What is the reason? That you will not be able to curse them, for I have blessed them." "<b>And in the Midrash:</b> ״לא תלך עמהם״ — You shall not go with them. He said to Him: If so, I will curse them in my place. ״לא תאור את העם״ — You shall not curse the people. He said to Him: If so, I will bless them. But they have no need for his blessing, for they are already blessed. A parable: they say to the hornet — we want neither your honey nor your sting."], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:34:56.511267434Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}